<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Renong to issue Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Renong to issue Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian conglomerate Renong Bhd said it expects to release its first quarter results for the three months ended September 30, 1996 later on Thursday.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman at the company, whose businesses include property development, said the results will be sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange after 5 p.m. (0900 GMT)</p>
<p>For the 1995 first quarter, Renong posted a net profit of 71.81 million ringgit, or 4.3 cents a share, on a turnover of 118.35 million ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
